# Run r1102b, slice 3 (scope.txt lines 34-66, without the FTW / TIE worldgen-census rows), boot A: superflat world from
# prep_srv.sh with spawn-animals=true (squid, cow, sheep rows) and the scratch probes of s3_setup.md copied in.
# Queue rows marked group B in old sections (MRD, FFH-02, STD-02, ABD, FSD-07) need no terrain: they run here.
# Order: boot-log rows (bootexpect / kjsexpect) first, then data rows (/zq, dumps + tools/scratch_query/dumpq.py), then
# block and bot rows, then the rows that /reload (SQ-PF-05, SQ-ATC-04, SQ-LGM-10) last. s3_A2.qb is the restart after.
#
# Superflat: grass at y -61, air from y -60. Row blocks sit in lane x 100..300 at z 500 (one x per row, listed in the row),
# the Farmer's template at 200 -60 540; all loaded by the first row's forceloads, with the probe spots: cbetest 400 400,
# salttest x 300.. z 60 (build top), pottest 290 290..350 310, wetest 96..127 96..127. Bots: perfBot, one name per row.
# Cooking Pot rows fill the pot with `data merge block` (FD keeps its ItemStackHandler in "Inventory": slots 0-5
# ingredients, 6 meal, 7 container, 8 output) over a lit campfire. "Break as a survival player" = /zact break.
pace 2

## SQ-BM-01 | Baby Mobs on a dedicated server: members line, no client class
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] members: \[.*\bbaby_mobs\b
bootreject (?i)baby ?mobs:.*(error|exception)
bootreject (?i)(BabyRender|BabyKit|LivingEntityRendererBabyMixin).*(error|exception|crash|not found)
bootreject (?i)baby_mobs\S*(mixin|class).*(error|exception|invalid dist)
shell grep -hE "Baby Mobs|baby_mobs|BabyKit|LivingEntityRendererBabyMixin" logs/latest.log logs/debug.log 2>/dev/null | head -20; echo "kjs handler errors: $(grep -c 'Error occurred while handling event' logs/kubejs/server.log)"; true
# lane and probe chunks for the whole batch (superflat generates fast; 30 s before any block tick)
> forceload add 96 496 300 560
> forceload add 400 400
> forceload add 290 290 350 310
> forceload add 300 60 400 60
> forceload add 96 96 127 127
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set noon
> weather clear 100000
> difficulty easy
sleep 30
look rows/SQ-BM-01.shell.txt: the client mixins (mixin/client/*) are not named as applied; no crash or mixin error naming a client class

## SQ-ROLL-01 | Roll Delight member loads (ROLL-01)
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] members: \[.*\broll_delight\b
bootexpect Found new data pack roll_upstream_data
bootreject (?i)(failed to parse|loot table).*roll_delight
kjsreject (?i)(error|exception).*roll_delight/
shell echo "kubejs server.log Error lines: $(grep -c Error logs/kubejs/server.log)"; true

## SQ-LGM-01 | Large Meals member loads (LGM-01)
